# Diagrams (Excalidraw → SVG)

Markdown **cannot** render `.excalidraw`. Maintain pairs under:

`documentation/assets/diagrams/<platform|observability|codeflow>/{svg,excalidraw}/`

## Source of truth

[`scripts/lib/diagram-specs.js`](scripts/lib/diagram-specs.js) + [`scripts/lib/diagram-paths.js`](scripts/lib/diagram-paths.js)

## Generators

- Observability: `node scripts/diagrams/generate-scenario-observability-diagrams.js`
- Codeflow: `node scripts/diagrams/generate-scenario-codeflow-diagrams.js`
- Inject observability section: `node detection-tools/es/generate-observability-section.js`
- Harness: `node scripts/diagrams/check-diagram-assets.js`

## Strict rules

1. Platform docs: SVG only (no Mermaid).
2. Scenario observability sections: SVG + Mermaid `sequenceDiagram`.
3. Scenario codeflow sections: SVG only under `## Code-level workflow`.
4. SVG must be well-formed XML - escape `&` as `&amp;`.
5. After edits: `node scripts/diagrams/check-diagram-assets.js`.
